      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Say Có thuốc say xe không? when you need \"Do you have motion sickness medicine\". This is for when travel motion is the problem and you want the medicine, not a doctor. Useful for buses, ferries, and mountain travel. Listen for a yes/no answer, a gesture toward the item, or a short alternative; use the next rows if the exchange moves on.",
